 "summary": "A series of 38 single silicon planar Zener diodes in the three-lead SOT-23 surface-mount package, rated 350 mW, with nominal Zener voltages from 2.4 V to 75 V. Each type's VZ window spans about ±2 % of nominal at the test current, and each carries its own two-letter marking code. BZX84B15 is the 15 V type: 14.7 V to 15.3 V at 5 mA, 30 Ω max, marking DZ.",
